{"html": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine rochas!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/0254a32fdfc19b516bce5b44770f203f.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/0254a32fdfc19b516bce5b44770f203f.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/0254a32fdfc19b516bce5b44770f203f.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep on Mining! é um jogo incremental simples. Passe o cursor sobre as rochas para minerá-las automaticamente. Qualquer rocha na área de mineração gera picaretas que mineram por você!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recolha materiais!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/6f0ac719c4215dc27443f46763e73c56.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/6f0ac719c4215dc27443f46763e73c56.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/6f0ac719c4215dc27443f46763e73c56.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As rochas mineradas soltam minérios, que são fundidos em barras. Existem vários tipos de rochas para minerar!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Árvore de habilidades!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/f1a70dcc5f5872409c1acc233043aa5c.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/f1a70dcc5f5872409c1acc233043aa5c.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/f1a70dcc5f5872409c1acc233043aa5c.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaste suas barras de materiais para desbloquear melhorias na árvore de habilidades. Essas melhorias aumentam permanentemente seus atributos, permitindo minerar com mais poder!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forje picaretas!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/b74d9035cbb257036b648723eb07e4f8.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/b74d9035cbb257036b648723eb07e4f8.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/b74d9035cbb257036b648723eb07e4f8.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use materiais diferentes para criar novas picaretas. Cada nova picareta tem atributos melhores, ajudando você a minerar mais rápido e com mais força!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cartas de talento!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/fdddf3935f1cbe74464bc7a27191c64d.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/fdddf3935f1cbe74464bc7a27191c64d.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/fdddf3935f1cbe74464bc7a27191c64d.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cada vez que você sobe de nível, ganha um ponto de talento. Gaste pontos de talento para revelar 3 cartas de talento aleatórias — escolha uma para ficar! Escolher uma carta aumenta o nível de talento, mas também aumenta a vida das rochas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Mina!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/a042dbf8127781dddf5b6afa3be6b4e0.poster.avif?t=1758806311\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/a042dbf8127781dddf5b6afa3be6b4e0.webm?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769130/extras/a042dbf8127781dddf5b6afa3be6b4e0.mp4?t=1758806311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depois de desbloqueada, a mina minerará rochas automaticamente e forjará barras instantaneamente. A Mina é a mecânica idle de Keep on Mining!</p>"}